(text "E13: eight independent UV/OV windows + coarse5V/3.3V guard. PRE_ANALOG_OK is generated in hardware, independent of MCU firmware." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 282eceae-7bea-5ef8-90b9-6cd77b0043ce))
(text "Monitor only: no power generation, rail disconnect/clamp, transient-fault or fabrication approval. Precision/offset/reference allocations require qualification." (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d5954da7-96c7-5c12-bee2-8ffb2a54d4d3))
(text "Each open-drain comparator has its own pull-up and hysteresis. Do NOT wire comparator outputs together; use the shown AND tree." (at 20.32 1038.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 68aaae13-88d3-561e-9c34-0ffba7d67a9b))
(text "Coarse guard holds qualification low while reference/sense amplifiers start. E09/E11/F02 retain settling and fresh-permit requirements." (at 20.32 1046.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 8d28f8c5-9335-53a0-a6ea-1ff61be4650d))
(text "Main-rail fault envelope extends to +/-3.2% with a conditional headroom review; normal generation remains +/-1%. Analog5V generation must be tighter than its4.90..5.10V accepted envelope." (at 20.32 1054.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ccc67757-59bd-59da-977a-88f544f52404))
